{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "164e6c5ac765093fa279cbafa28fda00c918099a4a9fa8fdb19d35e4269ae428", "ja": "誘惑の鱗粉", "zh": "诱惑的鳞粉", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "edd80ba7875ffa9a7868ee864f918e52dc12723656f9f29d12a2c1309d3309ed", "ja": "美希が単独出演するテレビ番組の収録を\n見学したい、とプロデューサーに頼み込む\nエレナ。見学を終えたエレナは、美希に\n最高の自分を見せたい！という熱意を胸に、\nレッスンに打ち込む。", "zh": "艾蕾娜拜托制作人，希望能去参观美希单独出演的电视节目录制。参观结束后，她怀着“想让美希看到最棒的自己！”的热情，全身心投入了练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22", "ja": "レッスン終了後……", "zh": "练习结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "d1a2336e94c5331ca833ccc6a170b74c63b8b3cdb1952153d68b61814de3e9bf", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}！\n明日、ミキにテレビのお仕事があるって本当？", "zh": "那个，那个，{$P$}！\n听说明天美希有电视工作，是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b314e7f805b58ecd25bda3bdfeafd2345b0d3ab984c879bbd9ce298a43764652", "ja": "おっ、情報が早いな、エレナ。そうなんだ。だから、\n夕方くらいまでは劇場に戻ってこれないけど……。", "zh": "哦，消息真灵通啊，艾蕾娜。是这样的。所以，差不多要到傍晚才能回剧场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "ff230ba25204c0910e573830c2bf6890a1533e0f65bf75360041ae7939828f69", "ja": "{$P$}、お願い！\nその収録、ワタシも連れてって！", "zh": "{$P$}，拜托了！\n那次录音，也带我一起去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d2f091f11b38e38de014e7369e29360ff01798745cb11412cb3b1ee8edb4701a", "ja": "見学するだけなら、大丈夫だと思うけど……\nずいぶん必死なんだな、エレナ。何かあったのか？", "zh": "只是旁观的话应该没问题……\n你还挺拼的嘛，艾莲娜。发生什么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "284eb38a1c88a8267ad13b7118272e4682257b3d6a494734011a6ef26103f6ee", "ja": "だってワタシ、公演でミキとペアを組むのに、\nミキに相手にされてない気がするんだもん……。", "zh": "可是，我要在公演上和美希搭档，却感觉美希根本没把我当回事嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "52bbe5817eb831ed0849bc03e5c04734485c3dc8015a67cfc57705fd704b11c6", "ja": "いや、そんな事はないと思うけど……。\nどうしてそう思ったんだ？", "zh": "不，我觉得应该不是那样的……\n你怎么会这么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "292b4bcad46ab38377c05be2d4d733375abb4573edee3f0011b1ca392cf17b2f", "ja": "それは、{$P$}だから……\nあっ、やっぱりなんでもないヨ！", "zh": "因为那是{$P$}……\n啊，还是算了，没什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "6ec02edf93cff1c74e9a5c5bdde8eed6de4bcdd84f28864202a648ace6daa4d1", "ja": "とにかく、これからのためにも、\nミキのステージを見ておきたいノ！", "zh": "总之，为了今后的发展，我想先看看美希的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d1bec42617a9183e2ce6c5804078ee8c41f2b5b07beb0e825be555190d44b752", "ja": "これからのためにも、か……。", "zh": "为了今后着想吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9d3d89ea74ff72d4ffd6a676a2dca600831e38f77f641a4e33066d46a63a9250", "ja": "そうだな、練習も毎日頑張ってるみたいだし、\nわかった。美希の収録に連れていくよ。", "zh": "是啊，她好像每天也都在努力练习……\n好吧，我带你去美希的录音现场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "700ecb3fb6a490e598276e5a583939be749138cda825d7538a3519abd6f7c90c", "ja": "！！\n{$P$}、ありがと～！", "zh": "！！{$P$}，谢谢你～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1012_null", "source_sha256": "f02f6b1fb10055524bff7f50accb3806ebdd0189a1f9e9f3c17e2f20ef7280d7", "ja": "翌日………", "zh": "第二天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9482cc1c644d134891b9771b35ebf3328661cef451fc9a8e21a25025fb65d696", "ja": "（今日は都内で、美希のテレビ収録。\n公演の宣伝になる、いいタイミングだな！）", "zh": "（今天是在东京都内录制美希的电视节目。\n正好是个能为公演宣传的好时机！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "349b5433d6d7e14dcbb770a910db91eb5363b0957af3e3b74b3162fc5dd3e985", "ja": "次は、ミキの番だよネ？　こんな有名な番組に\n出られるなんて、ミキ、すごいヨ……！", "zh": "接下来该美希了吧？能参加这么有名的节目，美希真厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6f131b07ad9206ac07ffe247d561879d2b0865552a3794f348b6b3df7942f80d", "ja": "ああ。今回は番組からのオファーだし、\nますます注目が……おっと、始まるみたいだ。", "zh": "啊。这次是节目主动发来的邀约，关注度也会越来越高……哎，好像要开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "e2c4f23a31befb9a574495e30c7bc89d2612d95950a872169153f9c2980da6ee", "ja": "みんな、こんにちはなの。\nミキから目を離しちゃ、ダメだからね♪", "zh": "大家好呀。\n可别把视线从美希身上移开哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "ccf0f23fe1c4ea5c3f9d379e11e0c93d43f63a194515790081fee5335d52c20c", "ja": "わあ……♪", "zh": "哇……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "aa807e3e293de78eb2cf1c0f9e929db1c3b3b4cc4909935eef34fda03abfb0d6", "ja": "（歌う美希を、エレナは食い入るように見つめていた。\nたぶん、スタジオの誰よりも真剣に……）", "zh": "（艾蕾娜目不转睛地注视着唱歌的美希。恐怕比录音室里的任何人都要认真……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2b1ed4a9f7e5914cbfe89b3775e472258a7c2334dad69cc7a6e6c8594971b7be", "ja": "（デュオ公演……改めて、\nこのふたりに決めてよかったかもしれないな）", "zh": "（二人组合公演……现在重新想想，或许选这两个人真是选对了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "7075f38d1231355632b0aa3de8cae32ac0dfa5cd0e613c1c092be1816edced6e", "ja": "ふう……{$P$}、エレナ。\nミキのステージ、どうだった？", "zh": "呼……{$P$}，艾蕾娜。美希的舞台，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c36c5be074427d24439510c869501e6eae39026c0138f141281c727727b22c8a", "ja": "お疲れさま、美希。\nうん、すごくいいステージだったよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，美希。\n嗯，是一场非常棒的演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "ca8655b1517d26362ecd990e3292bf1ef146e3a680f593a03c461266f4968dd0", "ja": "でしょ？\nミキ、けっこうがんばったんだから。", "zh": "对吧？\n美希可是很努力了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "2f30abb012cdabe00c16308f0fc37bb48c129c47c3cf0c77e7a95f37954e30d1", "ja": "ミキ、お疲れさま！\nすごかったヨー！！！", "zh": "美希，辛苦啦！\n太厉害了——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "36600ad9001dc51275483843d03cca7ddc5fa92ecf48d0d79342e81f3b86321e", "ja": "あ、エレナ。", "zh": "啊，艾蕾娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1025_018ele", "source_sha256": "31ed1ee76b7c04851904d2b90a250f04a343828fd12e4ac418e2b61059aac6af", "ja": "やっぱりミキってすごいんだネ！　ステージに\nいるだけで、自然と目が引き寄せられちゃった！", "zh": "果然美希还是很厉害呢！光是站在舞台上，目光就会不由自主地被她吸引过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "1680e17b11a6cdd697023488617fb19c2f631ef1124a6612c3f985eaba2620f7", "ja": "もちろん歌もダンスも完璧で、全部の中心に\nミキがいて……とにかくすごかったヨ～！！", "zh": "唱歌和跳舞当然也无可挑剔，美希\n就在一切的正中心……总之超级厉害的～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "1aef763ec042265bcc3d8e3cf6c835e8dff596932334a0c4d1d233ad2f688cd6", "ja": "あ、あれ？　ミキ？\nワタシ、へんなコト言った？", "zh": "啊、咦？美希？\n我说了什么奇怪的话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "e6f692ba6a0f73676a102e4a1b5dd8f861c0f66a0e48f0b971487e3d90739e97", "ja": "ううん。\nなんか、エレナって……翼みたい。", "zh": "没有啦。\n总觉得，艾莲娜……很像翼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "db3581093d5dd222d1bc3cb195dd1aaae5308e0f98a7fe51f198c0695a20616e", "ja": "え？　ワタシが、ツバサみたい？\n初めて言われたケド、どうして？", "zh": "诶？我像翼一样？还是第一次有人这么说，为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "23a072868438a4c87f21b6abd63406e9fc3bb426af19a5649adcd7c4386de458", "ja": "う～ん。なんか、いつも元気で、\n回りをぴょんぴょん飛び跳ねてるっていうか……。", "zh": "嗯～该怎么说呢，你总是活力满满的，\n感觉就像在大家身边蹦蹦跳跳的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "6408bdbcdf6f796f090b870cc23432bf40fd096a704c2d521e5a58fb71626e65", "ja": "回りをぴょんぴょん……？\nそれって、ツバサっていうより、犬みたいじゃない？", "zh": "在周围蹦蹦跳跳……？\n那听起来，与其说是翼，不如说是小狗吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1033_003mik", "source_sha256": "3cafe35e7225371299451ec80cb2c275c10a8e5352bfae07fdd47032eb00e9bc", "ja": "あ、そうかも？\nツバサもエレナも、なんだか犬っぽいの！", "zh": "啊，说不定还真是？\n翼和艾丽娜，总觉得都挺像小狗的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "e31a71847ee730f17c9b1de4f3e2068f6d397374b4091ec7283826ee62dc7728", "ja": "え～！？　ミキってば、ひどいヨ～！", "zh": "诶～！？美希真是的，太过分了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "296143652ae3fb79caca073e116797e4a561f77d180a351d653d275177c8bf3b", "ja": "あはっ。", "zh": "啊哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "e1500dc4a2b36f4419a80ad90af96ce95469b1a745e8f8b50b9eac3a0964bd96", "ja": "（確かに、美希に無下にされるところも含めて\n似てるような……いや、黙っておこう）", "zh": "（确实，连被美希冷落的地方也很像……不，还是别说了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1037_null", "source_sha256": "f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221", "ja": "その夜……", "zh": "那天夜里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "45121a1054eb97fff2c1bc21abc9a59c07c0a07eee81ccec303774a6fe1fe18b", "ja": "（あれ……？　全員帰ったはずなのに、\nまだレッスン室に明かりが点いてるな）", "zh": "（咦……？明明大家都回去了，为什么练习室还亮着灯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "06e84efa1e9aa2a814562a9818a46a8755ef6d0fa5fe7e862445f23d1c8f6b0d", "ja": "なんだ、誰か残ってると思ったらエレナだったのか。", "zh": "什么嘛，我还以为有人留下来了，原来是艾蕾娜啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1040_018ele", "source_sha256": "4e8cccec2fd095a8456346d7693a83cb1a5ab62bd01b60eab7e8c759ff19a446", "ja": "{$P$}？\n……あっ、もうこんな時間だったんだ！？", "zh": "{$P$}？\n……啊，居然已经这个时间了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1041_018ele", "source_sha256": "39f0b39436c45445a168bcffed708b679e50fbdb43996fa6273da7350a37d1d9", "ja": "ワタシ、集中してたみたい。\n遅くまで、ごめんネ。", "zh": "我好像太专注了。\n让你陪到这么晚，真不好意思哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "393b33808675d54feb242d52e219969f1780cd5b3907fde1a4f0de7dcf6ae480", "ja": "いや、かまわないよ。\n……今日の美希を見て、気合いが入ったのか？", "zh": "没事，我不介意。\n……看了今天的美希，你是不是也干劲十足了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1043_018ele", "source_sha256": "f733128fe701e6301f12677bc5710db50e4047ddc4099a9fc0600ebcf76e92af", "ja": "ウン！　ミキのステージを見たら、\n今のワタシじゃぜんぜん足りないかもって。", "zh": "嗯！看了美希的舞台表演后，我觉得现在的自己还远远不够。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1044_018ele", "source_sha256": "631b056eed2e9f09f41c4815324b9f463e9d34669bba4432bd0a0a3879fc10d1", "ja": "ミキの隣に立って、カッコよく見せるために……\nあとは、何をすればいいんだろうネ？", "zh": "站在美希身边，让自己看起来更帅气……  \n接下来还要做些什么才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "7e03c42d8a2bdeef9246d23328e8cf1e4fc34a4c15b3d5f7128c3cb628e322dd", "ja": "そうだな……。けど、ふたりのステージなんだし。\n美希に直接聞いてみてもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "是啊……不过，毕竟是你们两个人的舞台。直接问问美希不也可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1046_018ele", "source_sha256": "f6b86e319fd101c3386823cf973bc4d1317956bdb83f49bb18fbc87679479b60", "ja": "それはダメ！　だってミキは、\nデュオだけどライバルでもあるんだからネ。", "zh": "不行！因为美希虽然是双人搭档，也是竞争对手嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "d2e7195ce05f032986a4a0a885dcd50b7b53fadd2d699c57a27cdd6b7cfee073", "ja": "ひとりでも、ミキは最高だったでしょ？　だから\nワタシも、最高のワタシでぶつかりたいノ！", "zh": "就算是一个人，美希也很棒吧？所以我也想以最棒的自己去面对她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1048_p", "source_sha256": "63c206708680dce468a87d5d5ff0eac8fafcc52e25304c24d6439343a3615e24", "ja": "ライバルか……確かに、そういう気持ちも大切だな。\nわかった。けど、あまり抱え込まないでくれよ。", "zh": "对手吗……确实，这样的心情也很重要。\n我明白了。不过，别把一切都一个人扛着啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1049_018ele", "source_sha256": "fdb28ea842c7713e0e170eed3b0330d972ae52d31778ccf4c3f807d708018ff9", "ja": "うん！　聞いてくれてありがとネ、\n{$P$}♪", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你愿意听我说哦，\n{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1050_018ele", "source_sha256": "f3c9599e97030ab583e6f572e349edb35cf2ed73bbaa5065fbbd1a00c5f8a36f", "ja": "明日もレッスンだし、ワタシ、もう帰らなくちゃ。\nすぐ着替えてくるからちょっと待っててネ！", "zh": "明天还要上课，我也该回去了。  \n我马上换好衣服就回来，等我一下哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_03_1051_p", "source_sha256": "fa3813573ed2d4ddd0a7bd29d542eb68cae5b55ddd494c4c9878f86510c8c42f", "ja": "（熱意があるのはなによりではある。\n水を差さず、ここは経過を見守ってみよう……）", "zh": "（有热情总归是件好事。还是别在这时候泼冷水，先看看进展吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
